  "description": "Linq Extension to provide Dynamic Where Condition with Groups, Child Groups & Filters and Dynamic Select, Dynamic Take If Positive Number, Pagination and Nesting Predicates with parenthesis. Use SearchInput class for Dynamic Where and PaginationInput for pagination (take, skip and sort). Also, provide DistinctBy, GroupBy, and GroupByAggregation.",
